' A room entered by rope (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 6`, Caves;
' room 3 is the rope room "Cave"). Without a rope in the selected character's
' pack the door stays shut: the log says so, and a v1.2 game has him say
' "I need rope" (`newburn?49`, `Condition.Process`), with "Okay". With `give
' item_rope` the same click goes in (`-> Cave`) and the rope is kept.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 173,258         ' into Caves
wait 60
mapclick 209,16          ' the rope room, thrown for from 75 away
wait 200
snap rope
quit
